with expansive patio, integrated spa, and luxury outdoor living space designed for estate homes.\" class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"grid-column column2\"><div class=\"grid-row row1\"><img src=\"/images/countries/custom-pool-builders-alachua-county-fl/luxury-custom-pool-design-south-florida-outdoor-living.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" data-w-id=\"53f4d2e0-9a7a-0e16-e20a-ab8f9e03c935\" alt=\"Modern luxury custom pool in South Florida featuring integrated spa, clean architectural lines, and high-end outdoor living design for upscale homes.\" class=\"image\"></div><div class=\"grid-row row2\"><img src=\"/images/where-we-serves/custom-pool-builders-north-florida/south-florida-custom-pool-builders-modern-backyard-design.avif\" loading=\"lazy\" data-w-id=\"8bad508e-9f02-2bc9-bf6d-6ac47990da3b\" alt=\"Luxury custom pool design in South Florida with modern geometric layout, premium stone decking, and resort-style backyard built by expert pool builders.\" class=\"image\"></div></div></div></div><div data-w-id=\"90fb4871-cccb-5a13-f9e4-95b1df0636a2\" class=\"trusted-divider-right\"><div class=\"block-contect-intro\"><h2 class=\"white\">Your Design-Build Pool &amp; Outdoor Living Specialists in South Florida</h2><div class=\"text-divider white\"><p>At Mr &amp; Mrs Outdoor Living, we serve South Florida homeowners seeking a fully managed, design-build pool construction process. Our team integrates custom pool design, structural engineering, permitting, and construction management under one accountable contractor. From concept development and 3D pool design through final construction, every project is executed with precision planning, climate-adapted materials, and strict code compliance—delivering refined outdoor environments built for longevity, performance, and architectural cohesion.</p><div class=\"div-block-7\"><div class=\"wrapper-cities-cms w-dyn-list\"><div role=\"list\" class=\"list-cities-cms-copy w-dyn-items\"><div role=\"listitem\" class=\"item-cities-cms w-dyn-item\"><a